  "description": "The princess's journey to become a king to survive! \n\nAn era when the country's fortunes are in decline. A prophecy spreads that: \"He who has all the treasures of heaven, sea and underworld shall ascend to the throne\". However, the prophecy is not for the Crown Prince, but for 'Princess Hogeol'. The crown prince learns of this and plans to kill the princess...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=794152), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8415253)",
